00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:00.989
The actress that they initially cast as that character

00:06:00.989 --> 00:06:02.236
they ended up firing.

00:06:02.236 --> 00:06:04.220
The actress you ended up seeing as Barbara Kean right now

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:08.180
that's the person that they brought on after the fact so I think they changed her story line.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.270
I don't think this Barbara is going to turn into Batgirl or anything like that.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.328
It's way too soon even if they are going to do that.

00:06:13.328 --> 00:06:16.589
Usually what you see is a character go through some crucible like some

00:06:16.589 --> 00:06:19.128
