00:06:20.342 --> 00:06:22.860
That's kind of what I'm hoping happens with Barbara.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.720
I'd really like to see her go off the rails in season two because of this experience.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.796
This experience drives her in more of like a Black Canary direction

00:06:29.796 --> 00:06:31.420
